WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/settings/components/AIUsageCard.tsx — the lightweight Helix "Usage today" settings card:
    <section aria-label="Usage today" rounded border p-4 space-y-1>
      <Subhead>Usage today</Subhead>
      <div grid grid-cols-3 gap-3>
        UsageCell( "Tokens in",      formatCount(data.input_tokens) )
        UsageCell( "Tokens out",     formatCount(data.output_tokens) )
        UsageCell( "Estimated cost", formatCurrency(microCentsToDollars(data.cost_micro_cents)) )
      </div>
      <Caption> data.call_count > 0 ? `${formatCount(call_count)} Helix calls today.`
                                    : "Usage populates as features run. …" </Caption>
    </section>
  Hooks  : useAiUsageToday() (data / isLoading / isError, TanStack Query @ INTERVALS.STANDARD),
           useFormatting() (formatCurrency = `${currencySymbol}${fmtNumber(amount, precision)}`), useTranslation('settings').
  Helpers: PLACEHOLDER = "—"; formatCount(n) = (n==null || !finite) ? "—" : fmtInt(n);
           microCentsToDollars(mc) = (mc==null || !finite) ? 0 : mc / 1_000_000.
  Cells degrade to "—" on (!data || isError). No native skeleton/empty/error/stale/offline branch exists in the
  web leaf — those are added here as the P4 leaf contract (loading skeleton, friendly empty, retryable error,
  freshness chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh).

