PARITY MAPPING  (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  <section> bordered          → VStack + RoundedRectangle.strokeBorder(Color.TS.border) (web border-subtle, no fill)
  <Subhead>                   → Text(Font.TS.bodySm.semibold, Color.TS.textSecondary)   (native @/components/ui Subhead role)
  UsageCell                   → label Text(Font.TS.caption, textMuted) over value Text(Font.TS.bodySm.medium, textPrimary, monospacedDigit)
  <Caption>                   → Text(Font.TS.caption, textMuted)                         (native @/components/ui Caption role)
  formatCount/fmtInt          → AIUsageFormat.integer  (NumberFormatter .decimal, 0 frac, grouping, halfUp, safeNumber)
  formatCurrency              → AIUsageFormat.currency  (symbol prefix + fmtNumber at userPrecision)
  microCentsToDollars         → AIUsageFormat.microCentsAsDollars  (mc / 1_000_000, null/non-finite ⇒ 0 — verbatim arithmetic)
  i18n                        → every string via AIUsageStrings (NSLocalizedString table "AIUsageCard", web t(key,default) fallback);
                                the 6 source keys preserved verbatim (the literal `ai.settings.usage.placeholder` key carries a
                                `// parity:allow` opt-out, the scanner's sanctioned mechanism for a key literally named "placeholder").
  a11y                        → section labelled "Usage today" (web aria-label); each cell .combine "{label}: {value}";
                                chip / refresh / retry labelled; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion honoured by TSFadeIn/TSSkeleton.
  telemetry                   → view.opened surface="AIUsageCard" emitted once from AIUsageModel.start() (P1/S11).

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading   → 3-up skeleton grid + caption bar (web isLoading).
  empty     → zeroed cells ("0" / "0" / "$0.00") + hint caption (web all-zeroes / call_count==0 rendering), never blank.
  error     → retryable error chrome (web isError, upgraded to a QueryError peer).
  data      → 3-up grid with live numbers + "{N} Helix calls today." caption.
  stale     → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline   → header chip + banner over last-known cells; no auto-refresh.

